# The linear families in K.3.2

This interface exports the checked marked-actor and restriction calculations
for the actual ten-dimensional SL₅(2) exterior square. The complete source
statement also requires GM04 Proposition 4.6/Table 7 module recognition,
the natural-module ratios and outer-field exclusions, the six-dimensional
A₈/S₈ alternatives, and the descended nine-dimensional tensor family over
F₂ˢ with quadratic ratio greater than two and cubic ratio five quarters.
Those branches and final assembly remain open; no module-list hypothesis is
being substituted for recognition.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript (1 March 2004), K.3.2,
printed pp.454–456/PDF pp.465–467.
-/
